Package: tlapalli
Title: R color palettes inspired by elements of Mexican and Mesoamerican culture
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Maria A.", "Torres-Meraz", , "ma.torresmeraz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Color palettes inspired by the colors of the culture of Mexico and Mesoamerica. All
    palettes are distinguishable for people with color vision deficiencies.
